   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Wonderful (The Way I Feel)** (1 other source): Performed with the Louisville Youth Orchestra [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Intro music**: rare: 9 archived performances [4]\n- **HeartBreakin Man**: back after 30 archived shows (804 days) [4]\n- **End Of) Run Thru**: rare: 8 archived performances [4]\n- **Move On Up**: rare: 10 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2010-10-29.ccm41.flac** (recommended): source not stated; 28 songs; 177 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Audio quality is excellent, aided significantly by the new venue's acoustics [3]\n- **mmj2010-10-29.mk41.flac16**: source not stated; 27 songs; 176 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Balloons dropped from the ceiling popped during the performance [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2010-10-29.ccm41.flac**: taped by Brent Stober; transferred by Brent Stober; source: Schoeps CCM41 (DINa) > Luntatec V2 > Sound Devices 702 @ 24/48 [1]\n- **mmj2010-10-29.mk41.flac16**: taped by Brian Porter; source: Schoeps mk41 (DINa/FOB) > kc5 > cmc6xt > Sonosax SX-M2 > Mytek Stereo 192 ADC > Tascam HD-P2 (24/48) [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Cricket Press Previous: [My Morning Jacket Live Archive - 2010-10-29 KFC Yum! Center - Louisville, KY](https://archive.mymorningjacket.net/index.php/shows/2010/2010-10-29-kfc-yum-center-louisville-ky) [7]",
